        CHECK_GOD{God Mode<br/>attivo?}:::decisionNode
        EXEC_SHELL[Execute:<br/>proc_open<br/>PowerShell/Bash]:::processNode
        CAPTURE_OUT[Capture Output:<br/>STDOUT + STDERR]:::processNode
        PARSE_OUT[Parse Output:<br/>Syntax Highlight]:::processNode
        STREAM_WS[Stream via WebSocket<br/>Real-time]:::processNode
        AUDIT_CMD[AuditLogger:<br/>LOG TERMINAL_COMMAND]:::securityNode
        END_TERM([✅ Output Visualizzato]):::endNode
        ERROR_TERM([❌ Comando Bloccato]):::errorNode

        START_TERM --> INPUT_CMD --> SANITIZE_CMD
        SANITIZE_CMD --> CHECK_DANGER
        CHECK_DANGER -->|Dangerous| CHECK_GOD
        CHECK_GOD -->|Not God| ERROR_TERM
        CHECK_GOD -->|God Mode| EXEC_SHELL
        CHECK_DANGER -->|Safe| EXEC_SHELL
        EXEC_SHELL --> CAPTURE_OUT --> PARSE_OUT
        PARSE_OUT --> STREAM_WS --> AUDIT_CMD
        AUDIT_CMD --> END_TERM
    end

